# Public build-time settings (VITE_*): never put secrets here, they ship to the browser.
# Empty = same origin: the dev/preview server proxies /v1 to API_PROXY_TARGET.
# In production set the API origin, which must be on the same site (app.example.com + api.example.com).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
# Dev/preview proxy target only (not exposed to the browser).
API_PROXY_TARGET=http://localhost:3000
# The API must run with: AUTH_COOKIE_MODE=true, APP_CORS_ALLOW_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173
# (and http://localhost:4173 for `vite preview`), the exact origins of this app.
